sequenceDiagram
  participant R as reactor of core 1
  participant N as network (socket)
  participant S as ObjectStore
  N->>R: message data arrived (poll)
  R->>R: task: decode MOSDOp ⇒ future<>
  R->>S: do_transaction(t) ⇒ future<>
  Note over R: no blocking; the next queued task runs<br/>(per-task limit: crimson_reactor_task_quota_ms = 0.5)
  S-->>R: promise.set_value() ⇒ continuation queued
  R->>R: .then(): build MOSDOpReply
  R->>N: send the reply ⇒ future<>
